			<div data-anim-scroll-group="Chip" data-component-list="L2Modal ChipVideo" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:chip">
					<h3>M5.<br>Creator. <br>Accelerator.</h3>
					
					<div>
						<h3>M5.<br>Creator. <br>Accelerator.</h3>
						<p>The M5 chip pushes the limits of what’s possible on iPad&nbsp;Pro to drive performance and efficiency like never before. A next-generation 10‑core GPU with powerful new Neural Accelerators <strong>dramatically speeds up AI tasks</strong> — from large language model (LLM) token generation to generative imagery. And the multithreaded CPU performance and faster memory deliver breakthrough speed for your workflows.</p>
						<div>
							<div>
									<picture id="overview-chip-icon-chip-m5-1" data-lazy="">
										<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
										<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/chip/icon_chip_m5__fhuwfgmmjg2u_small.png, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/chip/icon_chip_m5__fhuwfgmmjg2u_small_2x.png 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/chip/icon_chip_m5__fhuwfgmmjg2u_medium.png, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/chip/icon_chip_m5__fhuwfgmmjg2u_medium_2x.png 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/chip/icon_chip_m5__fhuwfgmmjg2u_large.png, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/chip/icon_chip_m5__fhuwfgmmjg2u_large_2x.png 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/chip/icon_chip_m5__fhuwfgmmjg2u_large.png" alt="Apple M5 chip logo">
									</picture>
									
								</div>
							<p>
								</p><figure>
									Up to <strong>6.7x faster</strong> pro rendering performance with ray tracing than iPad&nbsp;Pro with&nbsp;M1<sup><a href="#footnote-8" aria-label="Footnote 3" data-modal-close="">3</a></sup>
								</figure>
							<p></p>
							<p>
								</p><figure>
									Up to <strong>4x faster</strong> AI image generation than iPad&nbsp;Pro with&nbsp;M1<sup><a href="#footnote-9" aria-label="Footnote 4" data-modal-close="">4</a></sup>
								</figure>
							<p></p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			<section data-anim-scroll-group="Ipados" data-component-list="L2Modal IPadOS" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:ipados">
				<p>
					</p><h3>iPadOS and&nbsp;apps.<br>A tour de workforce.</h3>
				<p></p>
				
				<div>
					<p>
						</p><h3>iPadOS and&nbsp;apps.<br>A tour de workforce.</h3>
					<p></p>
					<p>iPadOS introduces a stunning new design with Liquid Glass and game-changing enhancements that put iPad&nbsp;Pro productivity on a new level. A <strong>reimagined, intuitive windowing system</strong> gives you greater power and flexibility than ever before. Run pro apps, play high-performance games, and take on creative projects of any size with an intuitive touch-first experience.</p>
					<div>
						<picture id="overview-ipados-productivity-1" data-lazy="">
							<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
							<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/productivity__fglytbpvc9ua_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/productivity__fglytbpvc9ua_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/productivity__fglytbpvc9ua_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/productivity__fglytbpvc9ua_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/productivity__fglytbpvc9ua_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/productivity__fglytbpvc9ua_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/productivity__fglytbpvc9ua_large.jpg" alt="iPad Pro attached to Magic Keyboard, front exterior, all connected to external Mac Studio Display, iPad Pro display with graphic design app, vibrant colors and text, Studio Display showing various apps and a 3D model">
						</picture>
						
						<p><strong>Next-level productivity</strong>. Open more windows at once, resize and rearrange them your way, and split your screen into thirds or&nbsp;quarters.</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<div>
							<picture id="overview-ipados-background-tasks-1" data-lazy="">
								<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
								<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/background_tasks__fryfoyba8ua2_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/background_tasks__fryfoyba8ua2_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/background_tasks__fryfoyba8ua2_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/background_tasks__fryfoyba8ua2_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/background_tasks__fryfoyba8ua2_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/background_tasks__fryfoyba8ua2_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/background_tasks__fryfoyba8ua2_large.jpg" alt="Background tasks notification showing progress of video export, file download, and moving notes to backup">
							</picture>
							
							<p>Intensive tasks run behind the scenes with <strong>Background Tasks</strong>. And you can easily manage everything that’s running with Live&nbsp;Activities.</p>
						</div>
						<div>
							<picture id="overview-ipados-pro-apps-2" data-lazy="">
								<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
								<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/pro_apps__ooav5rco79ui_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/pro_apps__ooav5rco79ui_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/pro_apps__ooav5rco79ui_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/pro_apps__ooav5rco79ui_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/pro_apps__ooav5rco79ui_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/pro_apps__ooav5rco79ui_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/ipados/pro_apps__ooav5rco79ui_large.jpg" alt="Video editing app with image of people posing on boulders in a rocky desert landscape, timeline, editing tools">
							</picture>
							
							<p>Capture and edit Smart HDR images and up to 4K ProRes video. Open and manipulate larger 3D scenes. And run more complex AI models, all with <strong>pro apps</strong>.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				
			</section>
			<section data-anim-scroll-group="Intelligence" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:apple intelligence">
				<div>
					<p>
						</p><h3><strong>Apple&nbsp;Intelligence.</strong><br>Works hard. <br>You take it&nbsp;easy.</h3>
					<p></p>
					<div>
						<picture id="overview-intelligence-hero-1" data-lazy="">
							<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
							<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/hero__dvebaktighme_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/hero__dvebaktighme_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/hero__dvebaktighme_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/hero__dvebaktighme_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/hero__dvebaktighme_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/hero__dvebaktighme_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/hero__dvebaktighme_large.jpg" alt="iPad Pro, front exterior  display with dark blue and green gradient background with multiple apps open, hand holding Apple Pencil Pro circling a sketch showing Apple Intelligence Image Wand feature">
						</picture>
						
					</div>
					<div>
						<p>iPad&nbsp;Pro is built for <strong>Apple&nbsp;Intelligence</strong>. Create, communicate, and get things done effortlessly with groundbreaking privacy protections at every&nbsp;step.<span><a href="#footnote-2" aria-label="Footnote ** symbol" data-modal-close="">**</a></span></p>
						
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
						<div>
							<picture id="overview-intelligence-chatgpt-1" data-lazy="">
								<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
								<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/chatgpt__hfcw18i7okuq_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/chatgpt__hfcw18i7okuq_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/chatgpt__hfcw18i7okuq_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/chatgpt__hfcw18i7okuq_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/chatgpt__hfcw18i7okuq_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/chatgpt__hfcw18i7okuq_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/chatgpt__hfcw18i7okuq_large.jpg" alt="Picture of an experimental depiction of a traditional Korean rice cake with an explanation of the photo's characteristics generated by Apple Intelligence with ChatGPT integration">
							</picture>
							
							<p>Do more with the help of Siri and <strong>ChatGPT</strong>. Explore new visual styles in Image Playground, ask questions about photos and documents, and leverage additional expertise.</p>
						</div>
						<div>
							<picture id="overview-intelligence-shortcuts-1" data-lazy="">
								<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
								<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/shortcuts__ce9n5o4xoq82_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/shortcuts__ce9n5o4xoq82_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/shortcuts__ce9n5o4xoq82_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/shortcuts__ce9n5o4xoq82_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/shortcuts__ce9n5o4xoq82_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/shortcuts__ce9n5o4xoq82_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/shortcuts__ce9n5o4xoq82_large.jpg" alt="Apple Intelligence icon and text prompt: 'Compare notes in Text and Transcription then summarize the differences'">
							</picture>
							
							<p><strong>Accelerate your workflows</strong> with shortcuts, intelligent actions that can summarize text, create images, or tap into Apple&nbsp;Intelligence models.</p>
						</div>
						<div>
							<picture id="overview-intelligence-clean-up-1" data-lazy="">
								<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
								<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/clean_up__cupei2ikd84m_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/clean_up__cupei2ikd84m_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/clean_up__cupei2ikd84m_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/clean_up__cupei2ikd84m_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/clean_up__cupei2ikd84m_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/clean_up__cupei2ikd84m_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/intelligence/clean_up__cupei2ikd84m_large.jpg" alt="Picture of a woman in a multicolored dress standing in a desert landscape with a lone tree in the background circled in a glowing rainbow gradient showcasing Apple Intelligence capability to erase background objects">
							</picture>
							
							<p>Use Clean Up to instantly <strong>remove unwanted distractions </strong> in your photos. Identify the object and remove it with a tap. Or for even greater precision, use your Apple&nbsp;Pencil.<sup><a href="#footnote-15" aria-label="Footnote 10" data-modal-close="">10</a></sup></p>
						</div>
					</div>
				<div>
								
								<p>Apple&nbsp;Intelligence is <strong>designed to protect your privacy</strong> at every step. It’s integrated into the core of iPad&nbsp;Pro through on-device processing. So it’s aware of your personal information without collecting your personal information. And with groundbreaking Private Cloud Compute, Apple&nbsp;Intelligence can draw on larger server-based models, running on Apple&nbsp;silicon, to handle more complex requests for you while protecting your&nbsp;privacy.</p>
							</div>
			</section>
			<div data-anim-scroll-group="Display" data-component-list="L2Modal" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:display">
						<h3>Ultra Retina XDR. The&nbsp;world’s most advanced display.</h3>
						<figure>
							
							<p>
								<a href="https://tv.apple.com/us/show/silo/umc.cmc.3yksgc857px0k0rqe5zd4jice?itscg=10000&amp;itsct=atv-ipad_pro-pmo_stm-apl-atv-251015" data-analytics-title="stream silo on apple tv with a subscription" data-analytics-exit-link="" rel="nofollow" data-rid-relay="{&quot;289&quot;:&quot;itsct&quot;}"><span>Stream <cite>Silo</cite> on Apple&nbsp;TV with a subscription</span><span></span></a> </p>
						</figure>
						<p>The Ultra Retina XDR display is built with groundbreaking tandem OLED technology, which generates amazing brightness, precise contrast, and extreme dynamic range performance. Advanced technologies like ProMotion and True&nbsp;Tone give you a <span><em>jaw-dropping visual experience</em></span>. And you can use Reference Mode for color-accurate workflows.</p>
						<ul role="list">
							<li role="listitem">
								<figure>
									<p>
										<span data-anim-keyframe="{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;a0t - 75vh&quot;,&quot;end&quot;:&quot;a0t + 50vh&quot;,&quot;cssClass&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;anchors&quot;: [&quot;.subsection-touts&quot;],&quot;toggle&quot;:false}">1000 nits</span>
										<span>full-screen brightness</span>
									</p>
								</figure>
							</li>
							<li role="listitem">
								<figure>
									<p>
										<span data-anim-keyframe="{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;a0t - 75vh&quot;,&quot;end&quot;:&quot;a0t + 50vh&quot;,&quot;cssClass&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;anchors&quot;: [&quot;.subsection-touts&quot;],&quot;toggle&quot;:false}">1600 nits</span>
										<span>peak HDR brightness</span>
									</p>
								</figure>
							</li>
							<li role="listitem">
								<figure>
									<p>
										<span data-anim-keyframe="{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;a0t - 75vh&quot;,&quot;end&quot;:&quot;a0t + 50vh&quot;,&quot;cssClass&quot;:&quot;slide&quot;,&quot;anchors&quot;: [&quot;.subsection-touts&quot;],&quot;toggle&quot;:false}">2,000,000:1</span>
										<span>contrast ratio</span>
									</p>
								</figure>
							</li>
							<li role="listitem">
								<figure>
									<p>
