					</div>
			<div data-anim-scroll-group="Design" data-component-list="L2Modal" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:design">
						<h3>Design.<br> A powerhouse of portability.</h3>
						<div>
							<p>Despite an unbelievably thin and light design, iPad&nbsp;Pro delivers astonishing power and all-day battery life<sup><a href="#footnote-10" aria-label="Footnote 5" data-modal-close="">5</a></sup> for game-changing productivity. And now with fast charging, get up to <strong>50 percent charge in around 30 minutes.<sup><a href="#footnote-16" aria-label="Footnote 11" data-modal-close="">11</a></sup></strong></p>
							<figure>
								
							</figure>
						</div>
					</div>
			<div data-anim-scroll-group="Apple Pencil Pro" data-component-list="L2Modal" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:apple pencil pro">
					<p>
						</p><h3>Apple&nbsp;Pencil&nbsp;Pro. <br> Engineered for <br>limitless creativity.</h3>
					<p></p>
					<div>
						<picture id="overview-apple-pencil-pro-pencil-hero-1" data-lazy="">
							<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
							<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/apple-pencil-pro/pencil_hero__lg9qkg94jnm2_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/apple-pencil-pro/pencil_hero__lg9qkg94jnm2_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/apple-pencil-pro/pencil_hero__lg9qkg94jnm2_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/apple-pencil-pro/pencil_hero__lg9qkg94jnm2_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/apple-pencil-pro/pencil_hero__lg9qkg94jnm2_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/apple-pencil-pro/pencil_hero__lg9qkg94jnm2_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/apple-pencil-pro/pencil_hero__lg9qkg94jnm2_large.jpg" alt="iPad Pro, front exterior, landscape orientation, side profile, space black color, hand holding Apple Pencil Pro, white, drawing abstract purple and pink design on display">
						</picture>
						
					</div>
					<div>
							<p>Apple&nbsp;Pencil sets the standard for how drawing, painting, handwriting, and note-taking should feel — <strong>intuitive, precise, and magical</strong>. All with pixel‑perfect precision, low latency, tilt sensitivity, and support for palm rejection. <br>And Apple&nbsp;Pencil&nbsp;Pro adds even more capabilities to bring your ideas to life like never before.<sup><a href="#footnote-7" aria-label="Footnote 2" data-modal-close="">2</a></sup></p>
							<p><a href="https://www.apple.com/apple-pencil/" data-analytics-title="explore more apple pencil features"><span>Explore more Apple&nbsp;Pencil features</span><span></span></a> </p></div>
				</div>
			<div data-anim-scroll-group="Magic Keyboard" data-component-list="L2Modal" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:magic keyboard">
						<h3>Magic&nbsp;Keyboard.<br> Precision at your fingertips.</h3>
						<div>
								<p>Magic&nbsp;Keyboard delivers an amazing typing and trackpad experience in a <span><em>sleek, portable design</em></span> with an aluminum palm rest.<sup><a href="#footnote-17" aria-label="Footnote 12" data-modal-close="">12</a></sup> The keyboard includes a function row and a large glass trackpad with haptic feedback for precise work and Multi‑Touch gestures.</p>
								<p><a href="https://www.apple.com/ipad-keyboards/" data-analytics-title="learn more about keyboards for ipad"><span>Learn more about keyboards for iPad</span><span></span></a>
							</p></div>
					</div>
			<div data-anim-scroll-group="Cameras" data-component-list="L2Modal" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:cameras">
					<div>
						<h3>Mics.<br>Cameras.<br>Action.</h3>
						<p><span><em>Shoot, edit, and share all on one device</em></span> with a pro camera system with LiDAR&nbsp;Scanner, studio-quality mics, and four speakers. Capture 4K ProRes video, record a podcast, and pick the right microphone for each app with the input chooser.</p>
						
					</div>
					<ul role="list">
						<li role="listitem">
							<div>
								<picture id="overview-cameras-ipadpro13-gen7-camera-1" data-lazy="">
									<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
									<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/ipadpro13_gen7_camera__enckj02dwwwi_large.png, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/ipadpro13_gen7_camera__enckj02dwwwi_large_2x.png 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/ipadpro13_gen7_camera__enckj02dwwwi_large.png" alt="Pro camera system icon">
								</picture>
								
							</div>
							<p><span><em>12MP Wide camera</em></span> with adaptive True&nbsp;Tone flash.</p>
						</li>
						<li role="listitem">
							<div>
								<picture id="overview-cameras-ipad-front-camera-landscape-1" data-lazy="">
									<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
