								</picture>
								
							</div>
							<p><span><em>Landscape 12MP Center Stage camera</em></span> puts you front and&nbsp;center.</p>
						</li>
						<li role="listitem">
							<div>
								<picture id="overview-cameras-waveform-1" data-lazy="">
									<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
									<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/waveform__cv7z8wmo7nwy_large.png, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/waveform__cv7z8wmo7nwy_large_2x.png 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/waveform__cv7z8wmo7nwy_large.png" alt="Microphone audio icon">
								</picture>
								
							</div>
							<p><span><em>Studio-quality mics</em></span> for great video&nbsp;calls.</p>
						</li>
						<li role="listitem">
							<div>
								<picture id="overview-cameras-speaker-wave-2-1" data-lazy="">
									<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
									<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/speaker_wave_2__ddppl2jc1vsm_large.png, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/speaker_wave_2__ddppl2jc1vsm_large_2x.png 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/cameras/speaker_wave_2__ddppl2jc1vsm_large.png" alt="Speaker icon">
								</picture>
								
							</div>
							<p><span><em>Four-speaker sound system</em></span> for rich&nbsp;audio.</p>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			<div data-anim-scroll-group="Connectivity" data-component-list="L2Modal" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:connectivity">
						<h3>Wi-Fi and cellular.<br>Grab-and-go connectivity.</h3>
						<div>
							<picture id="overview-connectivity-cellular-hero-1" data-lazy="">
								<source data-empty="" media="(min-width:0px)">
								<source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/connectivity/cellular_hero__ea2fpz3yplme_small.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/connectivity/cellular_hero__ea2fpz3yplme_small_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:734px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/connectivity/cellular_hero__ea2fpz3yplme_medium.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/connectivity/cellular_hero__ea2fpz3yplme_medium_2x.jpg 2x" media="(max-width:1068px)"><source srcset="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/connectivity/cellular_hero__ea2fpz3yplme_large.jpg, https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/connectivity/cellular_hero__ea2fpz3yplme_large_2x.jpg 2x" media="(min-width:0px)"><img src="https://www.apple.com/v/ipad-pro/aw/images/overview/connectivity/cellular_hero__ea2fpz3yplme_large.jpg" alt="iPad Pro, front exterior, space black color, left and right hands holding in landscape orientation, rounded corners, black display bezel, display showing a FaceTime conversation being live translated, and an educational app showing a presentation of 'Comparative Mythology' with text, diagrams, and handwritten notes">
							</picture>
							
						</div>
						<div>
							<div>
									<p>Workflows go wherever you do with the better performance and reliability of <span><em>Wi-Fi 7,</em><sup><a href="#footnote-18" aria-label="Footnote 13" data-modal-close="">13</a></sup></span> Bluetooth&nbsp;6, and Thread — all enabled by N1, our new wireless networking chip.</p>
									<p>The second-generation <span><em>C1X cellular modem</em></span> supports faster data speeds at greater efficiency while maintaining worldwide 5G coverage. So you can securely access files, communicate with collaborators, and back up data while out and about.<sup><a href="#footnote-19" aria-label="Footnote 14" data-modal-close="">14</a></sup></p>
								</div>
							<p>
								</p><figure>
									Up to <strong>50% faster</strong> cellular data performance
								</figure>
								<figure>
									<strong>Wi-Fi 7</strong>
								</figure>
								<figure>
									<strong>5G</strong>
								</figure>
							<p></p>
						</div>
					</div>
		</section>
		
